  ["concurrent map writes killed the process. Which sync type is a map made for goroutines?"] = "concurrent map writes がプロセスを殺した。goroutine のために作られた sync の型は？",
  ["concurrent.futures is the one API for both: ThreadPoolExecutor for waiting, ProcessPoolExecutor for computing. submit returns a Future whose result() blocks and re-raises; as_completed yields futures as they finish; executor.map keeps the order. asyncio joins in through run_in_executor, so an event loop can hand CPU work to processes without blocking."] = "concurrent.futures は両方に共通の API だ：待つなら ThreadPoolExecutor、計算するなら ProcessPoolExecutor。submit は Future を返し、その result() は止まって例外を投げ直す。as_completed は終わった順に future を返し、executor.map は順序を保つ。asyncio は run_in_executor で加わるので、イベントループは止まらずに CPU 仕事をプロセスへ渡せる。",
  ["const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n"] = "const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n",
