  ["def two_sum(nums, target):\n    seen = {}\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        if target - x in seen:\n            return seen[target - x], i\n        seen[x] = ___\n"] = "def two_sum(nums, target):\n    seen = {}\n    for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n        if target - x in seen:\n            return seen[target - x], i\n        seen[x] = ___\n",
  ['def valid(s):\n    pairs = {")": "(", "]": "[", "}": ___}\n    st = []\n    for c in s:\n        if c in "([{":\n            st.append(c)\n'] = 'def valid(s):\n    pairs = {")": "(", "]": "[", "}": ___}\n    st = []\n    for c in s:\n        if c in "([{":\n            st.append(c)\n',
  ["def, return, *args, lambda"] = "def、return、*args、lambda",
  ["default: runs when every channel would block. The till stays free."] = "default: は全 channel がブロックする時に実行。レジは空いたままです。",
  ["defaultdict(list) calls list() for a missing key. Go's map[string][]string with the nil-slice append trick, built in."] = "defaultdict(list) は欠けたキーに list() を呼ぶ。Go の map[string][]string と nil スライスの append の技を、組み込みで。",
  ["defer captures its arguments now, not later. What does this print?"] = "defer は引数を後ではなく今キャプチャします。何が出力される？",
  ["defer evaluates arguments immediately. defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() would print 2."] = "defer は引数を即座に評価します。defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() なら 2 が出ます。",
  ["defer f.Close(). The drawer shuts even if Pay fails."] = "defer f.Close()。Pay が失敗しても引き出しは閉まります。",
  ["defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // saved the till\n    }\n}()\n"] = "defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // レジを救った\n    }\n}()\n",
  ["del menu[k] raises if k is missing; menu.pop(k, None) removes quietly and returns the value."] = "del menu[k] は k がないと例外を投げる。menu.pop(k, None) は静かに消して値を返す。",
  ["delete(m, k) removes it. Maps grow by assignment, shrink by this."] = "delete(m, k) で削除。map は代入で増え、これで減ります。",
  ["delete(m, key). Safe if the key is already gone."] = "delete(m, key)。キーがすでに無くても安全です。",
  ["deque.popleft is O(1); that is why BFS uses a deque and never a list. Round two to Bo."] = "deque.popleft は O(1)。だから BFS は deque を使い、決してリストを使わない。第2ラウンドはボーに。",
  ["derive Serialize and Deserialize, then serde_json::to_string and from_str. Attributes shape the JSON."] = "Serialize と Deserialize を derive し、serde_json::to_string と from_str。属性で JSON の形を決める。",
  ["derive(Serialize, Deserialize) needs the derive feature in Cargo.toml. serde_json does the format."] = "derive(Serialize, Deserialize) には Cargo.toml の derive フィーチャが必要。フォーマットは serde_json が担当。",
  ["dict: hash, slot, compare. O(1) average, O(n) worst when everything collides. Go's map, Rust's HashMap."] = "dict: ハッシュ、スロット、比較。平均 O(1)、すべてが衝突すれば最悪 O(n)。Go の map、Rust の HashMap。",
  ["dict[str, float]. Go's map[string]float64, Rust's HashMap<String, f64>. TypedDict names each key."] = "dict[str, float]。Go の map[string]float64、Rust の HashMap<String, f64>。TypedDict は各キーに名前を付ける。",
  ["done := make(chan ___)   // zero bytes per value\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n"] = "done := make(chan ___)   // 1値あたり 0 バイト\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n",
  ['done = mp.Value("i", 0)\n\nwith done.___():\n    done.value += 1\n'] = 'done = mp.Value("i", 0)\n\nwith done.___():\n    done.value += 1\n',
  ['done = mp.Value("i", 0)\n\nwith done.get_lock():\n    done.___ += 1\n'] = 'done = mp.Value("i", 0)\n\nwith done.get_lock():\n    done.___ += 1\n',
  ["dp[0] = 0: zero coins make zero. Everything else waits at inf until a coin reaches it."] = "dp[0] = 0: 0枚で 0 を作る。他はコインが届くまで inf で待つ。",
  ["drop(tray) takes ownership and frees it. Normally the closing brace of the scope does this. No GC needed."] = "drop(tray) は所有権を受け取って解放する。ふだんはスコープの閉じ波かっこがこれをやる。GC はいらない。",
  ["drop(tx) runs Drop now. tx2 is dropped when its thread ends; with both gone, rx sees the end and the for loop stops."] = "drop(tx) は今すぐ Drop を走らせる。tx2 はそのスレッドが終わると drop される。両方消えれば rx は終端を見て、for ループが止まる。",
  ["drop(tx): the channel closes when the last Sender is gone. Queued jobs are still delivered first. Forget this and join waits forever."] = "drop(tx): 最後の Sender が消えるとチャネルが閉じる。並んでいるジョブは先に届けられる。これを忘れると join が永遠に待つ。",
  ['drop(tx);\n// wait for each cook; unwrap re-raises a panic from it\nfor h in handles {\n    h.___().unwrap();\n}\nprintln!("kitchen closed");\n'] = 'drop(tx);\n// 料理人ごとに待つ。unwrap はそこで起きた panic を投げ直す\nfor h in handles {\n    h.___().unwrap();\n}\nprintln!("kitchen closed");\n',
  ["drop, then join, in that order. Seven rounds, no misses, combo x7. The screen says HIRED and the crab on the kiosk waves."] = "drop、それから join、その順で。7 ラウンド、ミスなし、コンボ x7。画面に HIRED と出て、キオスクのカニが手を振る。",
  ["eggs = 25\ntrays = eggs ___ 6      # whole trays\nleft = eggs % 6         # 1 egg over\nprint(trays, left)\n"] = "eggs = 25\ntrays = eggs ___ 6      # 丸ごとのトレイ\nleft = eggs % 6         # 卵1個余り\nprint(trays, left)\n",
  ["elif chains tests top to bottom; the first true branch runs, the rest are skipped. No switch in Python before match."] = "elif は判定を上から下へ連ねる。最初に真になった分岐が実行され、残りは飛ばされる。match 以前の Python に switch はない。",
  ["entry(a).or_default() returns &mut Vec<u32>, so push works in one line. One hash lookup, not two."] = "entry(a).or_default() は &mut Vec<u32> を返すので、push が 1 行で書ける。ハッシュ検索は 2 回でなく 1 回。",
  ["entry(k).or_insert(0) returns &mut to the value; * dereferences it. get(k) returns Option, so a missing key is None, not a panic."] = "entry(k).or_insert(0) は値への &mut を返し、* で参照外しする。get(k) は Option を返すので、ないキーは panic ではなく None。",
  ["enum OrderError lists every failure. Debug is required by the Error trait later."] = "enum OrderError が失敗を全部並べる。Debug はあとで Error トレイトに必要になる。",
  ["enum Size { Small, Large } Variants can carry data too, like Some(12). match without a Medium arm is a compile error, not a bug at the till."] = "enum Size { Small, Large } バリアントは Some(12) のようにデータも持てる。Medium のアームが抜けた match はレジで起きるバグではなく、コンパイルエラーになる。",
  ['enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// a pattern test that returns true or false\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n'] = 'enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// true か false を返すパターン判定\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n',
  ["enumerate() gives (index, item). zip(prices) would give (dish, price). No off-by-one."] = "enumerate() は (index, item) を返す。zip(prices) なら (dish, price)。1ずれのバグなし。",
  ["enumerate(xs, start) yields (i, x). Never write for i in range(len(xs)) when you also need xs[i]."] = "enumerate(xs, start) は (i, x) を生む。xs[i] も要るときに for i in range(len(xs)) と書いてはいけない。",
  ["errgroup.WithContext cancels the shared ctx the moment one task fails, and Wait returns that first error. It is Go's Promise.all."] = "errgroup.WithContext は一つの仕事が失敗した瞬間に共有 ctx をキャンセルし、Wait はその最初のエラーを返す。Go 版の Promise.all だ。",
  ["error is an interface. Check err != nil. defer runs when the function returns."] = "error は interface です。err != nil を確認。defer は関数の return 時に実行されます。",
  ["error is interface{ Error() string }. Your own types can carry data."] = "error は interface{ Error() string }。自作の型にデータを持たせられます。",
  ["errors.As finds the first error of that type and stores it in re."] = "errors.As はその型の最初の error を見つけて re に格納します。",
  ["errors.Is compares values down the chain. Use it instead of ==."] = "errors.Is はチェーンをたどって値を比較します。== の代わりに使いましょう。",
  ["errors.New for fixed messages; name them ErrSomething at package level."] = "固定メッセージには errors.New。パッケージレベルで ErrSomething と名付けます。",
  ["errors.New makes one. %w wraps one. errors.Is and errors.As search the chain."] = "errors.New で作り、%w でラップ。errors.Is と errors.As でチェーンを探します。",
  ["eta.cache_info() shows hits and misses; eta.cache_clear() empties it. Arguments must be hashable. Round six to Bo."] = "eta.cache_info() がヒットとミスを見せる。eta.cache_clear() が空にする。引数はハッシュ可能でなければならない。第6ラウンドはボーに。",
  ["except KeyError as e: e is the exception; str(e) is its message, e.args the details. The name dies after the block."] = "except KeyError as e: e が例外。str(e) はそのメッセージ、e.args は詳細。名前はブロックの後で消える。",
  ["except ValueError: catches only that. A bare except: swallows everything, even Ctrl-C. Name the type."] = "except ValueError: はそれだけを捕まえる。裸の except: は Ctrl-C まで何でも飲み込む。型を書こう。",
  ["expect(msg) panics with msg on Err. Use it for real bugs, not for user input. The till is back; Siu Ming exhales."] = "expect(msg) は Err のとき msg を出して panic する。本当のバグに使い、ユーザー入力には使わない。レジが復活。シウミンが息をつく。",
  ['f = open("stock.csv", "w")\nf.write("egg,12\\n")\nf.___()      # flush and release; with does this for you\n'] = 'f = open("stock.csv", "w")\nf.write("egg,12\\n")\nf.___()      # フラッシュして解放。with はこれを代わりにやる\n',
  ['f"..." is an f-string: any expression inside {} is evaluated. {n:>4} pads, {price:.2f} rounds.'] = 'f"..." は f 文字列: {} の中のどんな式も評価される。{n:>4} は詰め物、{price:.2f} は丸め。',
