  ["get(1) made 1 fresh, so put(3) evicts 2. That trace is the whole interview: touch on read, evict the front on write."] = "get(1) で 1 が新しくなったので、put(3) は 2 を追い出す。このトレースが面接のすべて: 読みでタッチ、書きで前を追い出す。",
  ["get: the key was used just now, so it moves to the back of the order. First find its index. Which iterator method returns the index of the first match?"] = "get: キーはたった今使われたので、順序の後ろへ動く。まず添字を見つける。最初に一致した要素の添字を返すイテレータのメソッドは？",
  ["go build makes a single binary with no runtime to install. GOOS=linux cross-compiles."] = "go build はランタイム不要の単一バイナリを作ります。GOOS=linux でクロスコンパイル。",
  ["go f() is the whole of 'async': the call runs on its own goroutine and the current line moves on immediately."] = "go f() が「async」のすべてだ：呼び出しは自分の goroutine で走り、今の行はすぐ次へ進む。",
  ["go fetchMenu()\ntime.Sleep(time.Millisecond)\nfmt.Println(runtime.___())\n// 2: main, and the one nobody is waiting for\n"] = "go fetchMenu()\ntime.Sleep(time.Millisecond)\nfmt.Println(runtime.___())\n// 2：main と、誰も待っていないほう\n",
  ["go fry() returns at once. fry runs concurrently. Two burners, one program."] = "go fry() は即座に戻ります。fry は並行に走る。コンロ2つ、プログラム1つ。",
  ['go func() {\n    fry("hashbrown")\n}___                    // call it right away\n'] = 'go func() {\n    fry("hashbrown")\n}___                    // すぐに呼び出す\n',
