  ["heap.Pop swaps the root to the end first, so Pop returns the last element and shrinks. Fill both blanks."] = "heap.Pop はまず根を末尾に swap するので、Pop は最後の要素を返して縮める。空欄を 2 つ埋めよ。",
  ["heapq turns a list into a min-heap: heappush and heappop are O(log n), h[0] is the smallest. Keep a heap of size k and its root is the kth largest. nlargest, nsmallest and Counter.most_common are the shortcuts."] = "heapq はリストを min-heap にする: heappush と heappop は O(log n)、h[0] が最小。サイズ k のヒープを保てば、その根が k 番目に大きい。nlargest、nsmallest、Counter.most_common が近道。",
  ["heapq: kth largest, top k"] = "heapq: k 番目に大きい、上位 k",
  ["height is 1 plus the taller of the two subtrees. Which method picks the larger of two usize?"] = "height は 2 つの部分木の高い方に 1 を足したもの。2 つの usize から大きい方を選ぶメソッドは？",
