  ["is_some_and(|e| e < 10) beats map(..).unwrap_or(false). Review clean at 17:59. SHIPPED."] = "is_some_and(|e| e < 10) は map(..).unwrap_or(false) より良い。17:59 にレビュー完了。SHIPPED。",
  ['it = iter([1])\nnext(it)      # 1\ntry:\n    next(it)\nexcept ___:\n    print("belt empty")\n'] = 'it = iter([1])\nnext(it)      # 1\ntry:\n    next(it)\nexcept ___:\n    print("belt empty")\n',
  ["items.last() is items.get(len - 1). O(1), and no panic on an empty Vec. push at the end is O(1) amortized."] = "items.last() は items.get(len - 1)。O(1) で、空の Vec でも panic しない。末尾への push は償却 O(1)。",
  ["items[-1]. Python adds len for you. Constant time, like append at the end (amortized) and pop()."] = "items[-1]。Python が len を足してくれる。定数時間、末尾への append（償却）や pop() と同じ。",
  ["items[len(items)-1]. Python spells it items[-1]. Both constant time. So is append at the end, amortized."] = "items[len(items)-1]。Python は items[-1] と綴る。どちらも定数時間。末尾への append も償却すればそう。",
  ["iter() borrows, into_iter() consumes. map, filter, collect, sum, fold: no index bugs."] = "iter() は借用、into_iter() は消費。map、filter、collect、sum、fold: インデックスのバグなし。",
  ["iter() yields &T. into_iter() yields T and eats the Vec. Dish zero prints again."] = "iter() は &T を返す。into_iter() は T を返して Vec を食べる。0番の料理がまた印字される。",
  ["iter().sum() needs the result type written down. map, filter, count and collect live on the same chain."] = "iter().sum() は結果の型を書く必要がある。map、filter、count、collect も同じチェーンに乗る。",
  ["iter(x) calls x.__iter__(); next(it) calls __next__. That pair is the whole iterator protocol."] = "iter(x) は x.__iter__() を呼び、next(it) は __next__ を呼ぶ。この2つがイテレータプロトコルのすべて。",
  ["iter.Seq[T] is func(yield func(T) bool). for x := range Items() just works."] = "iter.Seq[T] は func(yield func(T) bool)。for x := range Items() がそのまま動きます。",
  ["j moves left as i moves right. Stop when they meet."] = "i が右へ進むとき j は左へ。出会ったら止まる。",
  ["jobs := make(chan int, 10)\nresults := make(chan int, 10)\nvar wg sync.WaitGroup\nfor w := 1; w <= 3; w++ {\n    wg.___(1)\n    go worker(jobs, results, &wg)\n}\n"] = "jobs := make(chan int, 10)\nresults := make(chan int, 10)\nvar wg sync.WaitGroup\nfor w := 1; w <= 3; w++ {\n    wg.___(1)\n    go worker(jobs, results, &wg)\n}\n",
  ["jobs = [(p, 512) for p in photos]\nwith mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    pool.___(resize, jobs)\n"] = "jobs = [(p, 512) for p in photos]\nwith mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    pool.___(resize, jobs)\n",
  ["jobs.join() returns when every put has a matching task_done. daemon=True lets the idle cooks die with main. Seven rounds, no misses. HIRED, at midnight, in Python."] = "jobs.join() はすべての put に対応する task_done が付いたら戻る。daemon=True で暇なコックはメインと共に終わる。7ラウンド、ミスなし。深夜、Python で、HIRED。",
  ["join! waits for all; select! returns on the first. 200 ms total instead of 400."] = "join! は全部を待つ。select! は最初のひとつで返る。合計 400 ms ではなく 200 ms。",
  ["join() blocks until the child exits. Without it the parent can reach the end of the script and leave orphans behind."] = "join() は子が終了するまで止まる。これがないと親はスクリプトの末尾に着き、孤児を残しかねない。",
  ["join() blocks until the thread ends and returns Result<T>; Err means the thread panicked. 180 seconds to steep."] = "join() はスレッドが終わるまでブロックし、Result<T> を返す。Err はスレッドが panic したということ。蒸らし時間は 180 秒。",
  ["json only sees exported fields. Name the item field: Item or item?"] = "json はエクスポートされたフィールドしか見ません。item フィールドの名前は: Item か item か？",
  ["json sees exported fields only. Tags pick the key. Marshal out, Unmarshal in."] = "json はエクスポートされたフィールドだけ。タグでキーを指定。Marshal で出し、Unmarshal で入れる。",
  ["k contenders left; the smallest of them is the kth largest overall. Which index holds it?"] = "候補が k 個残った。その最小が全体で k 番目に大きい。それを持つインデックスは？",
  ["k positions behind the newest one."] = "最新のものから k 個後ろ。",
  ["kb = 2 ___ 10\nprint(kb)          # 1024\n"] = "kb = 2 ___ 10\nprint(kb)          # 1024\n",
  ["key= is called once per item; sort by its result. sorted(words, key=str.lower) is the case-insensitive classic."] = "key= は項目ごとに1回呼ばれる。その結果でソートする。sorted(words, key=str.lower) は大文字小文字を無視する定番。",
  ["kth largest: keep only the k biggest in a MIN-heap, so the smallest of them sits on top. BinaryHeap is a max-heap: which std::cmp wrapper flips the order?"] = "k 番目に大きい値: 大きい k 個だけを MIN ヒープに保ち、その中の最小が一番上に来る。BinaryHeap は max-heap: 順序をひっくり返す std::cmp のラッパーは？",
  ["l only moves right, so each character enters and leaves once: O(n) despite the nested while."] = "l は右にしか動かないので、各文字は一度入って一度出る: 入れ子の while があっても O(n)。",
  ["l[i] <= r[j] keeps the merge stable. The leftovers are appended with extend. O(n) per merge."] = "l[i] <= r[j] がマージを安定に保つ。余りは extend で後ろに足す。1 回のマージは O(n)。",
  ['label := fmt.___("%s $%d", item, price)   // "set $25"\n'] = 'label := fmt.___("%s $%d", item, price)   // "set $25"\n',
  ["lambda o: o[1] is an anonymous one-expression function. For anything longer, use def."] = "lambda o: o[1] は式1つの無名関数。それより長いものは def を使う。",
  ["largest compares with >. Which trait must T promise?"] = "largest は > で比べる。T が約束すべきトレイトは？",
  ["last := items[len(items)___]    // still O(1): len is stored\n"] = "last := items[len(items)___]    // それでも O(1): len は保存されている\n",
  ["last := map[rune]int{}\nl, best := 0, 0\nfor r, c := range s {\n    if p, ok := last[c]; ok && p >= l {\n        l = p + 1           // jump past the repeat\n    }\n    last[c] = ___\n"] = "last := map[rune]int{}\nl, best := 0, 0\nfor r, c := range s {\n    if p, ok := last[c]; ok && p >= l {\n        l = p + 1           // 重複の先へ飛ぶ\n    }\n    last[c] = ___\n",
  ["last = items[___]    # still O(1): negative indexes count from the end\n"] = "last = items[___]    # それでも O(1): 負のインデックスは末尾から数える\n",
  ["len counts bytes. 灣 is one character. In UTF-8, how many bytes?"] = "len はバイト数を数えます。灣 は1文字。UTF-8 では何バイト？",
  ["len is how many you can see. cap is how many fit before a new array."] = "len は見えている数。cap は新しい配列なしで入る数。",
  ["len is what is waiting, cap is the buffer size. A buffer smooths bursts; it never removes the need to handle a slow consumer."] = "len は待っている数、cap はバッファの大きさ。バッファは山を均すだけで、遅い消費者に対処する必要をなくしはしない。",
  ["len works on lists, strings, dicts, sets, anything with __len__. It is O(1): the length is stored."] = "len はリスト、文字列、dict、set、__len__ を持つものなら何にでも効く。O(1): 長さは保存されている。",
  ["len() is bytes. Slicing &s[0..4] in the middle of 鑼 panics: not a char boundary."] = "len() はバイト数。鑼 の途中で &s[0..4] とスライスすると panic: 文字境界ではない。",
  ["len() returns usize. The second let shadows n with a new binding; the old one is gone. Next tram in 7."] = "len() は usize を返す。2 つ目の let は新しい束縛で n をシャドーイングし、古い方は消える。次のトラムは 7 分後。",
  ["len(a) // 2 splits [3, 1, 2] into [3] and [1, 2]. Each level halves; log2(n) levels."] = "len(a) // 2 は [3, 1, 2] を [3] と [1, 2] に分ける。各段で半分に。log2(n) 段。",
  ["len(s) - 1 is the last index. Two pointers meet in the middle: O(n) time, O(1) space. s == s[::-1] is the one-liner."] = "len(s) - 1 が最後のインデックス。2つのポインタは真ん中で出会う: O(n) 時間、O(1) 空間。s == s[::-1] が一行版。",
  ["len(s) is bytes, not characters. That is why the sign counted nine."] = "len(s) は文字数ではなくバイト数。だから看板は9と数えたのです。",
  ["let (mut i, mut j) = (0, a.len() - 1);     // a is sorted\nwhile i < j {\n    match (a[i] + a[j]).cmp(&target) {\n        Ordering::Equal => return Some((i, j)),\n        Ordering::Less => i += 1,        // need more\n        Ordering::Greater => j ___ 1,    // need less\n    }\n"] = "let (mut i, mut j) = (0, a.len() - 1);     // a はソート済み\nwhile i < j {\n    match (a[i] + a[j]).cmp(&target) {\n        Ordering::Equal => return Some((i, j)),\n        Ordering::Less => i += 1,        // もっと必要\n        Ordering::Greater => j ___ 1,    // 減らしたい\n    }\n",
  ["let (mut lo, mut hi) = (0, a.len());\nwhile lo < hi {\n    let mid = lo + (hi - lo) ___ 2;   // integer division on usize\n    if a[mid] < x { lo = mid + 1 } else { hi = mid }\n}\n"] = "let (mut lo, mut hi) = (0, a.len());\nwhile lo < hi {\n    let mid = lo + (hi - lo) ___ 2;   // usize の整数除算\n    if a[mid] < x { lo = mid + 1 } else { hi = mid }\n}\n",
  ['let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\n// Two tills, one kitchen: each till needs its own sender.\nlet tx2 = tx.___();\nthread::spawn(move || tx.send("till 1").unwrap());\nthread::spawn(move || tx2.send("till 2").unwrap());\nfor msg in rx { println!("{msg}"); }\n'] = 'let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\n// レジ 2 台、厨房 1 つ: 各レジに自分の送信者が要る。\nlet tx2 = tx.___();\nthread::spawn(move || tx.send("till 1").unwrap());\nthread::spawn(move || tx2.send("till 2").unwrap());\nfor msg in rx { println!("{msg}"); }\n',
  ['let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\nlet tx2 = tx.clone();\nthread::spawn(move || tx2.send("bun").unwrap());\n___(tx);   // otherwise the loop below never ends\nfor msg in rx { println!("{msg}"); }\n'] = 'let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\nlet tx2 = tx.clone();\nthread::spawn(move || tx2.send("bun").unwrap());\n___(tx);   // これがないと下のループが終わらない\nfor msg in rx { println!("{msg}"); }\n',
  ["let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\ntx.send(7).unwrap();\n// The kitchen waits here until an order arrives.\nlet order: u32 = rx.___().unwrap();\n"] = "let (tx, rx) = mpsc::channel();\ntx.send(7).unwrap();\n// 厨房はここで注文が来るまで待つ。\nlet order: u32 = rx.___().unwrap();\n",
  ["let Reverse(kth) = ... destructures the wrapper in the pattern. peek is O(1)."] = "let Reverse(kth) = ... はパターンでラッパーを分解する。peek は O(1)。",
  ["let Some(x) = opt else { return }; binds x for the rest of the function. No nesting."] = "let Some(x) = opt else { return }; で関数の残り全体に x を束縛。ネストなし。",
  ["let b = a.___();    // allocate n ints and copy: O(n) time, O(n) space\n"] = "let b = a.___();    // n 個の int を確保してコピー: O(n) 時間、O(n) 空間\n",
  ["let b = s.as_bytes();\nlet mut seen = HashSet::new();\nlet (mut l, mut best) = (0, 0);\nfor r in 0..b.len() {\n    while seen.contains(&b[r]) {\n        seen.___(&b[l]);    // the left end leaves\n        l += 1;\n"] = "let b = s.as_bytes();\nlet mut seen = HashSet::new();\nlet (mut l, mut best) = (0, 0);\nfor r in 0..b.len() {\n    while seen.contains(&b[r]) {\n        seen.___(&b[l]);    // 左端が出ていく\n        l += 1;\n",
  ["let bill = vec![18, 0, 42, 0, 25];\n// into_iter gives i32; the closure sees &i32\nlet ok: Vec<_> = bill.into_iter().___(|p| *p > 0).collect();\nassert_eq!(ok, vec![18, 42, 25]);\n"] = "let bill = vec![18, 0, 42, 0, 25];\n// into_iter は i32 を返す。クロージャには &i32 が見える\nlet ok: Vec<_> = bill.into_iter().___(|p| *p > 0).collect();\nassert_eq!(ok, vec![18, 42, 25]);\n",
  ["let binds. mut allows change. const needs a type. as converts. A new let can shadow an old name."] = "let で束縛。mut で変更を許可。const には型が必要。as で変換。新しい let は古い名前をシャドーイングできる。",
  ['let dish = "curry rice";\nlet qty = 2;\n// like println! but it returns the String\nlet line = ___!("{qty} x {dish}");\n'] = 'let dish = "curry rice";\nlet qty = 2;\n// println! に似ているが String を返す\nlet line = ___!("{qty} x {dish}");\n',
  ['let dishes = ["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// nothing runs before this call; turbofish names the type\nlet lens = dishes.iter().map(|d| d.len()).___::<Vec<_>>();\nassert_eq!(lens, vec![10, 7, 5]);\n'] = 'let dishes = ["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// この呼び出しまで何も動かない。ターボフィッシュで型を指名\nlet lens = dishes.iter().map(|d| d.len()).___::<Vec<_>>();\nassert_eq!(lens, vec![10, 7, 5]);\n',
  ['let dishes = ["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// yields (usize, &&str) pairs, starting from 0\nfor (i, d) in dishes.iter().___() {\n    println!("{}. {d}", i + 1);\n}\n'] = 'let dishes = ["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// 0 から始まる (usize, &&str) の組を返す\nfor (i, d) in dishes.iter().___() {\n    println!("{}. {d}", i + 1);\n}\n',
  ['let dishes = vec!["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// borrows every element as &&str; dishes stays usable\nfor d in dishes.___() {\n    println!("ticket: {d}");\n}\n'] = 'let dishes = vec!["curry rice", "noodles", "toast"];\n// 各要素を &&str として借用。dishes はそのまま使える\nfor d in dishes.___() {\n    println!("ticket: {d}");\n}\n',
  ['let district = "銅鑼灣";\nlet n = district.___().count();\nassert_eq!(n, 3);\n// the receipt now cuts at whole characters\n'] = 'let district = "銅鑼灣";\nlet n = district.___().count();\nassert_eq!(n, 3);\n// これでレシートは文字単位で切れる\n',
  ["let else, matches!, impl Trait, ..=, ? on Option, is_some_and: less nesting, same safety."] = "let else、matches!、impl Trait、..=、Option への ?、is_some_and: ネストは減り、安全性は同じ。",
  ['let eta: Option<u32> = fetch_eta_cached(order.id);\n// Rust 1.70: None -> false, Some(e) -> the closure result\nlet fast = eta.___(|e| e < 10);\nif fast { println!("promise the customer 10 minutes"); }\n'] = 'let eta: Option<u32> = fetch_eta_cached(order.id);\n// Rust 1.70: None -> false、Some(e) -> クロージャの結果\nlet fast = eta.___(|e| e < 10);\nif fast { println!("promise the customer 10 minutes"); }\n',
  ['let menu = vec!["bun", "egg tart", "milk tea"];\n// Borrow menu from threads; all end before the block does.\nthread::___(|s| {\n    s.spawn(|| println!("{}", menu[0]));\n    s.spawn(|| println!("{}", menu[1]));\n});\n'] = 'let menu = vec!["bun", "egg tart", "milk tea"];\n// スレッドから menu を借用。全部ブロックより先に終わる。\nthread::___(|s| {\n    s.spawn(|| println!("{}", menu[0]));\n    s.spawn(|| println!("{}", menu[1]));\n});\n',
  ["let mut b = a.clone();    // a second Vec of n ints: O(___)\nb.sort();\n"] = "let mut b = a.clone();    // n 個の int の2つ目の Vec: O(___)\nb.sort();\n",
  ["let mut count = 0; Immutable by default is Rust's first safety rule. The sign counts again."] = "let mut count = 0; デフォルトで不変、これが Rust の安全ルール第一条。看板がまた数え始める。",
  ["let mut counts: HashMap<&str, u32> = HashMap::new();\nfor w in \"muffin coffee muffin\".split(' ') {\n    // start at 0 if w is new, then bump it either way\n    *counts.entry(w).___(0) += 1;\n}\nassert_eq!(counts[\"muffin\"], 2);\n"] = "let mut counts: HashMap<&str, u32> = HashMap::new();\nfor w in \"muffin coffee muffin\".split(' ') {\n    // w が新しければ 0 から。どちらにせよ増やす\n    *counts.entry(w).___(0) += 1;\n}\nassert_eq!(counts[\"muffin\"], 2);\n",
  ["let mut handles = Vec::new();\nfor id in 0..3 {\n    let rx = Arc::clone(&rx);\n    // a new OS thread runs the closure; move hands over rx\n    handles.push(thread::___(move || worker(id, rx)));\n}\n"] = "let mut handles = Vec::new();\nfor id in 0..3 {\n    let rx = Arc::clone(&rx);\n    // 新しい OS スレッドがクロージャを走らせる。move で rx を渡す\n    handles.push(thread::___(move || worker(id, rx)));\n}\n",
  ["let mut ids = vec![9, 2, 7, 2, 5];\n// equal ids may swap places; nobody can tell\nids.___();\nassert_eq!(ids, [2, 2, 5, 7, 9]);\n"] = "let mut ids = vec![9, 2, 7, 2, 5];\n// 等しい id は入れ替わるかもしれないが、誰にも分からない\nids.___();\nassert_eq!(ids, [2, 2, 5, 7, 9]);\n",
  ['let mut left = 3;\n___ left > 0 {\n    left -= 1;\n    if left == 1 { continue; }   // skip this round\n    println!("{}", left);\n}\n'] = 'let mut left = 3;\n___ left > 0 {\n    left -= 1;\n    if left == 1 { continue; }   // この回はスキップ\n    println!("{}", left);\n}\n',
  ["let mut max = prices[0];\nfor &p in &prices[1..] {    // ___ comparisons\n    if p > max { max = p; }\n}\n"] = "let mut max = prices[0];\nfor &p in &prices[1..] {    // ___ 回の比較\n    if p > max { max = p; }\n}\n",
  ["let mut n = 0;\nfor r in 0..g.len() {\n    for c in 0..g[0].len() {\n        // land still standing: a new island, flood it\n        if g[r][c] == b'1' { n += 1; ___(&mut g, r, c); }\n    }\n}\n"] = "let mut n = 0;\nfor r in 0..g.len() {\n    for c in 0..g[0].len() {\n        // まだ残る陸: 新しい島、流せ\n        if g[r][c] == b'1' { n += 1; ___(&mut g, r, c); }\n    }\n}\n",
  ['let mut order = String::new();\norder.___("curry rice");\norder.___(" + hash brown");\nlet loud = order.to_uppercase();\n'] = 'let mut order = String::new();\norder.___("curry rice");\norder.___(" + hash brown");\nlet loud = order.to_uppercase();\n',
  ["let mut seen = ___::new();\nfor g in &guests {               // one pass: O(n)\n    if !seen.insert(g) { dup = true; }   // false = already there\n}\n"] = "let mut seen = ___::new();\nfor g in &guests {               // 一巡: O(n)\n    if !seen.insert(g) { dup = true; }   // false = もうあった\n}\n",
  ["let mut st: Vec<char> = Vec::new();\nfor c in s.chars() {\n    let open = closer_of(c);\n    if open == '\\0' {\n        st.___(c);          // wait here for the closer\n        continue;\n    }\n"] = "let mut st: Vec<char> = Vec::new();\nfor c in s.chars() {\n    let open = closer_of(c);\n    if open == '\\0' {\n        st.___(c);          // ここで閉じ括弧を待つ\n        continue;\n    }\n",
  ['let mut tray = vec![7, 8];\n// pop returns an Option: a value, or None if empty.\nif let ___(id) = tray.pop() {\n    println!("serving order {id}");\n}\n'] = 'let mut tray = vec![7, 8];\n// pop は Option を返す: 値か、空なら None。\nif let ___(id) = tray.pop() {\n    println!("serving order {id}");\n}\n',
  ['let mut tries = 0;\nlet code = ___ {\n    tries += 1;\n    if tries == 3 { break tries * 10; }\n};\nprintln!("{}", code);   // 30\n'] = 'let mut tries = 0;\nlet code = ___ {\n    tries += 1;\n    if tries == 3 { break tries * 10; }\n};\nprintln!("{}", code);   // 30\n',
  ["let n = if a > b { a } else { b }; Both branches must have the same type. n is 22."] = "let n = if a > b { a } else { b }; 両方の分岐は同じ型でなければならない。n は 22。",
  ['let order = Order { name: "toast".into(), qty: 2 };\n// takes a reference; returns Result<String, Error>\nlet text = serde_json::___(&order)?;\nassert_eq!(text, r#"{"name":"toast","qty":2}"#);\n'] = 'let order = Order { name: "toast".into(), qty: 2 };\n// 参照を受け取り、Result<String, Error> を返す\nlet text = serde_json::___(&order)?;\nassert_eq!(text, r#"{"name":"toast","qty":2}"#);\n',
  ['let order = String::from("pineapple bun");\n// The thread may outlive this block: give it the String.\nlet h = thread::spawn(___ || {\n    println!("toasting {order}");\n});\nh.join().unwrap();\n'] = 'let order = String::from("pineapple bun");\n// スレッドはこのブロックより長生きするかも: String を渡してしまう。\nlet h = thread::spawn(___ || {\n    println!("toasting {order}");\n});\nh.join().unwrap();\n',
  ["let price = 28; The type is inferred as i32. Without mut it can never change."] = "let price = 28; 型は i32 と推論される。mut がなければ二度と変えられない。",
  ['let prices = [18, 22, 45, 60];       // already sorted\n// halve the range each step\nmatch prices.___(&45) {\n    Ok(i) => println!("found at {i}"),\n    Err(i) => println!("would insert at {i}"),\n}\n'] = 'let prices = [18, 22, 45, 60];       // もうソート済み\n// 毎回、範囲を半分にする\nmatch prices.___(&45) {\n    Ok(i) => println!("found at {i}"),\n    Err(i) => println!("would insert at {i}"),\n}\n',
  ["let prices = vec![18, 42, 25];\n// acc starts at 0; the closure returns the next acc\nlet total = prices.iter().___(0, |acc, p| acc + p);\nassert_eq!(total, 85);\n"] = "let prices = vec![18, 42, 25];\n// acc は 0 から始まる。クロージャが次の acc を返す\nlet total = prices.iter().___(0, |acc, p| acc + p);\nassert_eq!(total, 85);\n",
  ["let prices = vec![18, 42, 25];\n// the turbofish tells it which number type to add into\nlet total = prices.iter().___::<i32>();\nassert_eq!(total, 85);\n"] = "let prices = vec![18, 42, 25];\n// ターボフィッシュでどの数値型に足し込むか伝える\nlet total = prices.iter().___::<i32>();\nassert_eq!(total, 85);\n",
  ["let qty = vec![1, 2, 3];\n// a closure: the parameter sits between two pipes\nlet doubled: Vec<i32> = qty.iter().map(___ x * 2).collect();\nassert_eq!(doubled, vec![2, 4, 6]);\n"] = "let qty = vec![1, 2, 3];\n// クロージャ: 引数は2本のパイプの間に置く\nlet doubled: Vec<i32> = qty.iter().map(___ x * 2).collect();\nassert_eq!(doubled, vec![2, 4, 6]);\n",
  ["let sold = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0u32));\n// Each thread needs its own handle to the same counter.\nlet mine = ___(&sold);\nthread::spawn(move || { *mine.lock().unwrap() += 1; });\n"] = "let sold = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0u32));\n// 各スレッドに同じカウンタへの自分のハンドルが要る。\nlet mine = ___(&sold);\nthread::spawn(move || { *mine.lock().unwrap() += 1; });\n",
  ["let sold = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0u32));\n// Take the guard; it opens again when it goes out of scope.\nlet mut n = sold.___().unwrap();\n*n += 1;\n"] = "let sold = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0u32));\n// ガードを取る。スコープを抜けるとまた開く。\nlet mut n = sold.___().unwrap();\n*n += 1;\n",
  ["let tail = items.___();    // Some(&x) or None; still O(1)\n"] = "let tail = items.___();    // Some(&x) か None。それでも O(1)\n",
  ['let text = r#"{"dish":"toast","tags":["hot","new"]}"#;\n// an enum: Null, Bool, Number, String, Array, Object\nlet v: serde_json::___ = serde_json::from_str(text)?;\nprintln!("{}", v["tags"][0]);   // "hot"\n'] = 'let text = r#"{"dish":"toast","tags":["hot","new"]}"#;\n// enum: Null、Bool、Number、String、Array、Object\nlet v: serde_json::___ = serde_json::from_str(text)?;\nprintln!("{}", v["tags"][0]);   // "hot"\n',
  ['let text = r#"{"name":"noodles","qty":1}"#;\n// the type annotation tells serde what to build\nlet order: Order = serde_json::___(text)?;\nassert_eq!(order.qty, 1);\n'] = 'let text = r#"{"name":"noodles","qty":1}"#;\n// 型注釈が serde に何を組み立てるか伝える\nlet order: Order = serde_json::___(text)?;\nassert_eq!(order.qty, 1);\n',
  ["let total: i32 = prices.iter().sum();        // n steps\nlet max = prices.iter().max();                // n more\n// 2n steps, written O(___)\n"] = "let total: i32 = prices.iter().sum();        // n ステップ\nlet max = prices.iter().max();                // さらに n\n// 2n ステップ、O(___) と書く\n",
  ["let total: i32 = prices.iter().sum();   // ___ : n items, n adds\n"] = "let total: i32 = prices.iter().sum();   // ___ : n 項目、n 回の加算\n",
  ['let typed = "18";\n// FromStr does the work; the turbofish picks the type\nlet qty = typed.___::<i32>()?;\nprintln!("{qty} sets");\n'] = 'let typed = "18";\n// FromStr が仕事をする。ターボフィッシュで型を選ぶ\nlet qty = typed.___::<i32>()?;\nprintln!("{qty} sets");\n',
  ['light := "green"\n___ light {\ncase "green":\n    walk()\n}\n'] = 'light := "green"\n___ light {\ncase "green":\n    walk()\n}\n',
  ["list(a), a[:] or a.copy(): all shallow, all O(n). Allocation is where space complexity is paid."] = "list(a)、a[:]、a.copy(): すべて浅く、すべて O(n)。確保が空間複雑度を支払う場所。",
  ["list[str] since 3.9; typing.List[str] before. Go's []string, Rust's Vec<String>."] = "3.9 から list[str]、以前は typing.List[str]。Go の []string、Rust の Vec<String>。",
  ["lo = mid + 1 drops the left half. Each step halves the range: O(log n). The array must be sorted first."] = "lo = mid + 1 は左半分を捨てる。各ステップで範囲が半分に: O(log n)。配列は先にソートされていなければならない。",
  ["lo, hi := 0, len(a)\nfor lo < hi {\n    mid := (lo + hi) ___ 2   // integer division in Go\n    if a[mid] < x { lo = mid + 1 } else { hi = mid }\n}\n"] = "lo, hi := 0, len(a)\nfor lo < hi {\n    mid := (lo + hi) ___ 2   // Go の整数除算\n    if a[mid] < x { lo = mid + 1 } else { hi = mid }\n}\n",
  ["lo, hi := 0, len(a)         // [lo, hi)\nfor lo < hi {\n    mid := lo + (hi-lo)/___\n"] = "lo, hi := 0, len(a)         // [lo, hi)\nfor lo < hi {\n    mid := lo + (hi-lo)/___\n",
  ["lo, hi = 0, len(a)\nwhile lo < hi:\n    mid = (lo + hi) ___ 2    # floor division\n    if a[mid] < x: lo = mid + 1\n    else: hi = mid\n"] = "lo, hi = 0, len(a)\nwhile lo < hi:\n    mid = (lo + hi) ___ 2    # 切り捨て除算\n    if a[mid] < x: lo = mid + 1\n    else: hi = mid\n",
  ["lock = threading.___()\nserved = 0\n\ndef serve():\n    global served\n    with lock:\n        served += 1\n"] = "lock = threading.___()\nserved = 0\n\ndef serve():\n    global served\n    with lock:\n        served += 1\n",
  ["lock() returns a MutexGuard; unwrap fails only if another thread panicked while holding it. The guard unlocks on drop."] = "lock() は MutexGuard を返す。unwrap が失敗するのは、別スレッドが握ったまま panic したときだけ。ガードは drop でロックを外す。",
  ["log n levels, n work per level: O(n log n). The base case is a slice of 0 or 1."] = "段数は log n、1 段あたりの仕事は n: O(n log n)。基底ケースは長さ 0 か 1 のスライス。",
  ["log prints and returns nothing. What goes after the arrow?"] = "log は印字し、何も返さない。矢印の後には何が来る？",
  ["log() prints but never returns. What does print(log('x')) show on its second line?"] = "log() は印字するが何も返さない。print(log('x')) の2行目には何が出る？",
  ['log.Fatal(http.___(":8080", nil))   // nil = default mux\n'] = 'log.Fatal(http.___(":8080", nil))   // nil = デフォルトの mux\n',
  ["longest returns one of its inputs. Which lifetime does the return value carry?"] = "longest は入力のどちらかを返す。戻り値が持つライフタイムは？",
  ["loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\nsize = await loop.___(ex, resize, photo)\n"] = "loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\nsize = await loop.___(ex, resize, photo)\n",
  ["loop { ... break value; } is an expression. code becomes 30. The gate stops spinning."] = "loop { ... break value; } は式。code は 30 になる。ゲートの空回りが止まる。",
  ["low:high. Includes low, excludes high. Same backing array, no copy."] = "low:high。low を含み high を含まない。同じ内部配列、コピーなし。",
  ["lows[-1] is always the minimum of what is on st. pop both lists together. O(1) push, pop and get_min."] = "lows[-1] は常に st 上の最小値。pop は両リスト一緒に。push、pop、get_min すべて O(1)。",
  ["m := <-res blocks this goroutine, not the program. That is exactly what await does, minus the keyword and minus the coloured functions."] = "m := <-res が止めるのはこの goroutine であって、プログラムではない。キーワードと色付きの関数を除けば、それはまさに await だ。",
  ["macOS and Windows do not fork by default. Name their start method."] = "macOS と Windows は既定では fork しない。その開始方式の名前は？",
  ["main can fail in many ways. Which pointer type wraps any dyn Error?"] = "main はいろんな形で失敗しうる。どんな dyn Error も包むポインタ型は？",
  ["main sends on an unbuffered channel with nobody receiving. The runtime reports: all goroutines are asleep - ___!"] = "main が受信者のいないバッファなし channel に送信。ランタイムの報告：all goroutines are asleep - ___!",
  ["make (or a {} literal) before the first write. Reading a nil map is safe."] = "最初の書き込みの前に make(か {} リテラル)。nil map の読み取りは安全です。",
  ["make(T, len, cap) for slices, maps, channels. new(T) only gives a zeroed pointer."] = "make(T, len, cap) は slice、map、channel 用。new(T) はゼロ値への pointer を返すだけ。",
  ["make([]int, len(a)) then copy. Allocation is where space complexity is paid; the garbage collector collects the rent later."] = "make([]int, len(a)) それから copy。確保が空間複雑度を支払う場所。ガベージコレクタが後で家賃を集める。",
  ["make(chan string). Unbuffered: send waits for receive."] = "make(chan string)。バッファなし：送信は受信を待ちます。",
  ["map with an i in front, as in iterator. There is an _unordered twin that is faster."] = "map の前に i、iterator の i。もっと速い _unordered の双子もある。",
  ["map, then [key type], then value type."] = "map、次に [キーの型]、次に値の型。",
  ["map[K]bool is the everyday set. Missing keys read as false."] = "map[K]bool が日常の set。ないキーは false と読めます。",
  ["map[string]bool as a set: one O(1) lookup per guest, O(n) total. Fifty million checks become ten thousand."] = "集合としての map[string]bool: 客ごとに O(1) の検索1回、合計 O(n)。5000万回のチェックが1万回になる。",
  ["map[string]int. make(map[string]int) if you start empty."] = "map[string]int。空から始めるなら make(map[string]int)。",
  ["map[string]int: hash, bucket, compare. O(1) average, O(n) worst when everything collides. Python's dict, Rust's HashMap."] = "map[string]int: ハッシュ、バケット、比較。平均 O(1)、すべてが衝突すれば最悪 O(n)。Python の dict、Rust の HashMap。",
  ["maps.Keys and maps.Values return iter.Seq, so range works on them directly."] = "maps.Keys と maps.Values は iter.Seq を返すので、そのまま range できます。",
  ['match a.binary_search(&x) {     // ___\n    Ok(i) => println!("at {i}"),\n    Err(i) => println!("insert at {i}"),\n}\n'] = 'match a.binary_search(&x) {     // ___\n    Ok(i) => println!("at {i}"),\n    Err(i) => println!("insert at {i}"),\n}\n',
  ["match code { 1 => ..., _ => ... } Each arm is pattern => value. The compiler checks every case is covered."] = "match code { 1 => ..., _ => ... } 各アームは パターン => 値。すべてのケースが網羅されているかコンパイラが確認する。",
  ["matches!(v, Pat) expands to match v { Pat => true, _ => false }. Guards allowed: Some(n) if n > 3."] = "matches!(v, Pat) は match v { Pat => true, _ => false } に展開される。ガードも可: Some(n) if n > 3。",
  ["max := prices[0]\nfor _, p := range prices[1:] {   // ___ comparisons\n    if p > max {\n        max = p\n    }\n}\n"] = "max := prices[0]\nfor _, p := range prices[1:] {   // ___ 回の比較\n    if p > max {\n        max = p\n    }\n}\n",
  ["memo = {}\ndef fib(n):\n    if n in ___:\n        return memo[n]\n    v = n if n < 2 else fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)\n    memo[n] = v\n    return v\n"] = "memo = {}\ndef fib(n):\n    if n in ___:\n        return memo[n]\n    v = n if n < 2 else fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)\n    memo[n] = v\n    return v\n",
  ["memo.get(&n) is O(1). Hit: return it. Miss: compute it. That is memoization."] = "memo.get(&n) は O(1)。ヒットなら返す。ミスなら計算する。それがメモ化。",
  ["memo.get(&n) is O(1). Hit: return. Miss: compute and insert. Go spells this the comma-ok test; Python @functools.cache."] = "memo.get(&n) は O(1)。ヒット: 返す。ミス: 計算して insert。Go はこれを comma-ok テストと綴り、Python は @functools.cache。",
  ['menu = ___\nmenu["tea"] = 12\nmenu["noodles"] = 38\nprint(menu["tea"])     # 12\n'] = 'menu = ___\nmenu["tea"] = 12\nmenu["noodles"] = 38\nprint(menu["tea"])     # 12\n',
  ['menu = ___(tea=12, noodles=38)\nprice = menu["tea"]    # hash the key, jump to the slot\n'] = 'menu = ___(tea=12, noodles=38)\nprice = menu["tea"]    # キーをハッシュし、スロットへ跳ぶ\n',
  ["menu = {\"tea\": 12, \"noodles\": 38}\ndishes = list(menu.___())\nprint(dishes)     # ['tea', 'noodles']\n"] = "menu = {\"tea\": 12, \"noodles\": 38}\ndishes = list(menu.___())\nprint(dishes)     # ['tea', 'noodles']\n",
  ['menu = {"tea": 12, "noodles": 38}\nprint(menu.___("congee", 0))   # 0, no KeyError\n'] = 'menu = {"tea": 12, "noodles": 38}\nprint(menu.___("congee", 0))   # 0、KeyError なし\n',
  ["menu = {\"tea\": 12, \"toast\": 18}\n___ menu[\"toast\"]\nprint(menu)     # {'tea': 12}\n"] = "menu = {\"tea\": 12, \"toast\": 18}\n___ menu[\"toast\"]\nprint(menu)     # {'tea': 12}\n",
  ['menu: ___[str, float] = {"tea": 12.0}\n'] = 'menu: ___[str, float] = {"tea": 12.0}\n',
  ["min, max and clear joined len, cap, append in Go 1.21."] = "Go 1.21 で min、max、clear が len、cap、append の仲間入り。",
  ["module, go, require. go.sum next to it holds the checksums."] = "module、go、require。隣の go.sum がチェックサムを保持します。",
  ["most_common uses heapq.nlargest inside when k is given. Count in O(n), pick in O(n log k). Round four to Bo."] = "k を与えると most_common は内部で heapq.nlargest を使う。数えるのは O(n)、選ぶのは O(n log k)。第4ラウンドはボーに。",
  ["move || captures by value. Without it the closure would borrow order, and a borrow cannot be proven to outlive the thread."] = "move || は値でキャプチャする。なければクロージャは order を借用するが、借用がスレッドより長く生きるとは証明できない。",
  ["mp.Process is a whole python interpreter of its own. It costs milliseconds to start, not microseconds: give it work worth the trip."] = "mp.Process はそれ自体が一つの python インタプリタだ。起動にはマイクロ秒ではなくミリ秒かかる：往復の価値がある仕事を与えよう。",
  ["mp.Queue is safe for many producers and many consumers. It must be created in the parent and passed in as an argument, never made inside the child."] = "mp.Queue は生産者も消費者も多数で安全だ。親で作って引数として渡さねばならず、子の中で作ってはいけない。",
  ["mp.Value('i', 0) is four bytes of shared memory with a type code. The object is shared; the number inside it is what you touch."] = "mp.Value('i', 0) は型コード付きの共有メモリ 4 バイトだ。共有されるのはそのオブジェクトで、あなたが触るのは中の数字だ。",
  ["mp.cpu_count() is Go's runtime.NumCPU(). It counts logical cores, so on a laptop with hyper-threading it is twice the physical ones."] = "mp.cpu_count() は Go の runtime.NumCPU() だ。論理コアを数えるので、ハイパースレッディングのノートでは物理コアの二倍になる。",
  ["mpsc: multi-producer, single-consumer. Job is Send so it may cross to another thread; FnOnce because each ticket runs once."] = "mpsc: multi-producer, single-consumer。Job は Send なので別のスレッドへ渡れる。伝票は一度しか走らないので FnOnce。",
  ["mpsc::channel gives a Sender and a Receiver. Clone the Sender for many producers; the loop ends when all are dropped."] = "mpsc::channel は Sender と Receiver をくれる。生産者を増やすなら Sender を clone。全部 drop されるとループが終わる。",
  ["mpsc::channel() returns (Sender<T>, Receiver<T>). mpsc: multi-producer, single-consumer. The pipe is unbounded."] = "mpsc::channel() は (Sender<T>, Receiver<T>) を返す。mpsc: multi-producer, single-consumer。パイプは無制限。",
  ["mu.Lock()\ndefer mu.___()          // even on panic\ncount++\n"] = "mu.Lock()\ndefer mu.___()          // panic 時も\ncount++\n",
  ['mu.Lock()\nmenu["set"] = 42\nmu.Unlock()\n\nmu.___()\n'] = 'mu.Lock()\nmenu["set"] = 42\nmu.Unlock()\n\nmu.___()\n',
  ["multiprocessing copies the threading API onto processes, so the code looks the same and the cores actually fill up."] = "multiprocessing は threading の API をプロセスの上に写す。だからコードは同じに見え、コアは本当に埋まる。",
  ["multiprocessing.Process(target=f, args=(x,)) is threading's API on a real process: start() forks or spawns it, join() waits, exitcode says how it went and daemon=True lets it die with the parent. Under the spawn start method the child imports your file again, so everything that runs must sit behind if __name__ == '__main__'."] = "multiprocessing.Process(target=f, args=(x,)) は threading の API を本物のプロセスに載せたものだ：start() が fork か spawn で立ち上げ、join() が待ち、exitcode が結果を告げ、daemon=True なら親と一緒に死ぬ。spawn 方式では子があなたのファイルをもう一度 import するので、走るものはすべて if __name__ == '__main__' の後ろに置かねばならない。",
  ["mypy runs no code; it reads the hints. Go and Rust do this in the compiler; Python does it on request. The labels print right."] = "mypy はコードを走らせない。ヒントを読む。Go と Rust はコンパイラでこれをやり、Python は求められたときにやる。ラベルが正しく印字される。",
  ["n := 7\nhalf := ___(n) / 2      // 3.5, not 3\n"] = "n := 7\nhalf := ___(n) / 2      // 3 ではなく 3.5\n",
  ["n := runtime.___()\nfor i := 0; i < n; i++ {\n    go worker(jobs, done)\n}\n"] = "n := runtime.___()\nfor i := 0; i < n; i++ {\n    go worker(jobs, done)\n}\n",
  ['n = 4\nprint(___"tables open: {n}")\n'] = 'n = 4\nprint(___"tables open: {n}")\n',
  ["n doubles from 1000 to 2000 items. An O(1) operation takes how long compared to before, in one word?"] = "n が 1000 から 2000 に倍になる。O(1) の操作は以前と比べてどれだけかかる？ 一語で。",
  ["n in memo is O(1). Hit: return it. Miss: compute, store, return. That is memoization, spelled out."] = "n in memo は O(1)。ヒット: 返す。ミス: 計算して保存して返す。それが、書き出したメモ化。",
  ["n is an int. Divide it as a floating point number. Fill: half := ___(n) / 2"] = "n は int。浮動小数点数として割ってください。埋める: half := ___(n) / 2",
  ["n pushes and pops on a heap of k: O(n log k) time, O(k) space. Sorting would be O(n log n) and O(n)."] = "サイズ k のヒープに n 回の push と pop: 時間 O(n log k)、空間 O(k)。ソートなら O(n log n) と O(n)。",
  ["n times the logarithm of n. No comparison sort can beat it in the worst case."] = "n 掛ける n の対数。最悪の場合にこれを破る比較ソートはない。",
  ["n+1 distinct inputs, each solved once. Linear, without the O( )."] = "n+1 個の異なる入力、それぞれ1回解く。線形、O( ) なしで。",
  ['n, ___ := prices["hashbrown"]\nif !___ {\n    // missing\n}\n'] = 'n, ___ := prices["hashbrown"]\nif !___ {\n    // 見つからない\n}\n',
  ["n-1 comparisons, which is O(n): you cannot know the max without seeing every value. The diagonal is drawn."] = "n-1 回の比較、つまり O(n): すべての値を見ずに最大を知ることはできない。対角線が描かれた。",
  ["n-1 comparisons, which is O(n): you cannot know the max without seeing every value. iter().max() does exactly this."] = "n-1 回の比較、つまり O(n): すべての値を見ずに最大を知ることはできない。iter().max() はまさにこれをする。",
  ["n-1 comparisons, which is O(n): you cannot know the max without seeing every value. max() does exactly this."] = "n-1 回の比較、つまり O(n): すべての値を見ずに最大を知ることはできない。max() はまさにこれをする。",
  ['name = ___("Order for: ")\nprint(f"one bowl for {name}")\n'] = 'name = ___("Order for: ")\nprint(f"one bowl for {name}")\n',
  ['names := []string{"Wing", "Bo", "Mei"}\nsort.___(names)          // O(n log n)\nfmt.Println(names)       // [Bo Mei Wing]\n'] = 'names := []string{"Wing", "Bo", "Mei"}\nsort.___(names)          // O(n log n)\nfmt.Println(names)       // [Bo Mei Wing]\n',
  ['names = ["Mei", "Alex", "Mei", "Ken"]\nunique = ___(names)\nprint(len(unique))     # 3\n'] = 'names = ["Mei", "Alex", "Mei", "Ken"]\nunique = ___(names)\nprint(len(unique))     # 3\n',
  ['names = ["egg", "tea"]\nqtys = [2, 1]\nfor name, qty in ___(names, qtys):\n    print(qty, "x", name)\n'] = 'names = ["egg", "tea"]\nqtys = [2, 1]\nfor name, qty in ___(names, qtys):\n    print(qty, "x", name)\n',
  ['names = ["noodles", "tea", "toast"]\nshort_first = ___(names, key=len)    # O(n log n)\n'] = 'names = ["noodles", "tea", "toast"]\nshort_first = ___(names, key=len)    # O(n log n)\n',
  ["net/http: handlers and a server"] = "net/http: handler とサーバ",
  ["next() on an exhausted generator raises which exception?"] = "使い切ったジェネレータに next() を呼ぶと、どの例外が投げられる？",
  ["next(gen) runs to the next yield. next(gen, None) returns None at the end instead of raising."] = "next(gen) は次の yield まで走る。next(gen, None) は終端で例外の代わりに None を返す。",
  ["nil check first, then recurse. insert returns the (possibly new) subtree root."] = "まず nil チェック、それから再帰。insert は（新しいかもしれない）部分木の根を返します。",
  ["nlargest(n, xs, key=...) is O(n log k) and takes a key. sorted(xs)[-3:] would be O(n log n)."] = "nlargest(n, xs, key=...) は O(n log k) で key を取る。sorted(xs)[-3:] なら O(n log n)。",
  ["not st first: pop on an empty list raises IndexError. Then compare with the opener the dict expects."] = "まず not st: 空リストへの pop は IndexError を投げる。それから dict が期待する開き括弧と比べる。",
  ['note = ___          # nothing yet\nif not note:\n    print("no note")\n'] = 'note = ___          # まだ何もない\nif not note:\n    print("no note")\n',
  ['o := Order{Item: "set", Price: 25}\nfmt.Printf("___\\n", o)    // {Item:set Price:25}\n'] = 'o := Order{Item: "set", Price: 25}\nfmt.Printf("___\\n", o)    // {Item:set Price:25}\n',
  ["o.label() passes o as self automatically. Forgetting self is the most common TypeError in a beginner's class."] = "o.label() は o を自動的に self として渡す。self を忘れるのは初心者のクラスで最もよくある TypeError。",
  ["ok is false only when the channel is closed and drained. It says nothing about the value: that one is always the zero value."] = "ok が false になるのは channel が閉じて空になったときだけ。値については何も言っていない：そちらは常にゼロ値だ。",
  ["ok, an underscore, then the word you use to offer an alternative."] = "ok、アンダースコア、そして代案を示すときに使う単語。",
  ["ok_or(err) maps Some(v) to Ok(v) and None to Err(err). Now ? works on it too."] = "ok_or(err) は Some(v) を Ok(v) に、None を Err(err) に写す。これで ? も使える。",
