  ["prices = [6, 12, 38]\ndoubled = [p * 2 ___ p in prices]\nprint(doubled)     # [12, 24, 76]\n"] = "prices = [6, 12, 38]\ndoubled = [p * 2 ___ p in prices]\nprint(doubled)     # [12, 24, 76]\n",
  ["prices.len() is 3. is_empty() is the idiomatic way to ask for zero. The board counts to twelve."] = "prices.len() は 3。ゼロかどうかは is_empty() で聞くのが慣用的。ボードが 12 まで数える。",
  ["print writes a line. # starts a comment. f-strings put values in text. import brings a module in."] = "print は一行を書く。# はコメントの始まり。f 文字列は値をテキストに入れる。import はモジュールを持ち込む。",
  ["print() is a built-in: no import, no package. Python 3 needs the parentheses. The pass screen lights up."] = "print() は組み込み: import もパッケージも不要。Python 3 は括弧が必要。パスの画面が点く。",
  ["print(o) shows <Order object at 0x...>. Which special method gives it a readable form?"] = "print(o) が <Order object at 0x...> と出す。読みやすい形を与える特殊メソッドは？",
  ["printer.acquire()\ntry:\n    print_label(order)\nfinally:\n    printer.___()\n"] = "printer.acquire()\ntry:\n    print_label(order)\nfinally:\n    printer.___()\n",
  ["println is a macro, not a function. Which character ends its name?"] = "println は関数ではなくマクロ。名前の最後はどの文字？",
  ["push adds one char. This one adds a whole str. Two words, underscore."] = "push は char をひとつ足す。これは str をまるごと足す。2単語、アンダースコア。",
  ["push, underscore, the end that is not the front."] = "push、アンダースコア、前ではない方の端。",
  ["push_str borrows the &str and copies it in. to_uppercase() makes a new String."] = "push_str は &str を借用して中にコピーする。to_uppercase() は新しい String を作る。",
  ["put blocks only when maxsize is reached. put_nowait raises queue.Full instead."] = "put は maxsize に達したときだけブロックする。put_nowait は代わりに queue.Full を投げる。",
  ["put made the cache one too big. Remove the oldest pair, at the front. Which method, with last=False?"] = "put でキャッシュが1つ大きすぎた。先頭の最古の組を取り除く。last=False をつけて、どのメソッド？",
  ["put on a new key when the cache is full: the stale end goes first. Which VecDeque method removes the front as Option?"] = "キャッシュ満杯で新しいキーを put: 古い端が先に出ていく。前を Option として取り除く VecDeque のメソッドは？",
  ["q.get() blocks like <-ch in Go. get_nowait() raises queue.Empty instead, which is the select default case."] = "q.get() は Go の <-ch のように止まる。get_nowait() は代わりに queue.Empty を投げ、それが select の default に当たる。",
  ['q.put(Order(7, "set"))\nq.put(open("menu.txt"))\n# TypeError: the file object is not ___\n'] = 'q.put(Order(7, "set"))\nq.put(open("menu.txt"))\n# TypeError：file オブジェクトは ___ ではない\n',
  ["queue.Queue is thread-safe: put adds a job, get takes one, task_done marks it finished, join waits until every job is done."] = "queue.Queue はスレッド安全: put はジョブを追加し、get は1つ取り、task_done は終了を印し、join はすべてのジョブが終わるまで待つ。",
  ["queue.Queue locks every operation. Queue(maxsize=3) blocks put when full: a buffered channel."] = "queue.Queue はすべての操作をロックする。Queue(maxsize=3) は満杯で put をブロックする: バッファ付き channel。",
  ["queue[0] then queue[1:] is the Go queue. For big queues use a ring or container/list."] = "queue[0] の後に queue[1:] が Go のキュー。大きなキューにはリングか container/list を。",
  ["r - l + 1 is the window's width. Grow on the right, shrink on the left: O(n) with at most 256 bytes in the set."] = "r - l + 1 が窓の幅。右で伸ばし左で縮める: 集合は最大 256 バイトで O(n)。",
  ["r must be allowed to change a. Which two-part borrow gives write access?"] = "r は a を変更できなければならない。書き込みアクセスを与える 2 部構成の借用は？",
  ["raise ValueError(...) throws an instance. A bare raise inside except re-throws the current one."] = "raise ValueError(...) はインスタンスを投げる。except の中の裸の raise は現在のものを再送出する。",
  ["range 3 counts 0..2. Since 1.22 each iteration also gets its own i."] = "range 3 は 0..2 を数えます。1.22 からは各反復が独自の i を持ちます。",
  ["range decodes UTF-8 for you: byte index plus rune. string(r) turns it back."] = "range が UTF-8 をデコードしてくれます: バイト位置と rune。string(r) で戻せます。",
  ["range over a channel ends when the sender calls close. Without close it blocks forever."] = "channel の range は送信側が close を呼ぶと終わります。close がなければ永遠にブロックします。",
  ["range over a channel. Note the directional channel types in the signature."] = "channel を range する。シグネチャの方向付き channel 型に注目。",
  ["range over a string gives runes. Print each one as text: fill ___(r)"] = "string を range すると rune が得られます。それぞれを文字として表示: ___(r) を埋めてください",
  ["range over an int, min and max, slices and maps packages, iter.Seq for range."] = "int を range、min と max、slices と maps パッケージ、range 用の iter.Seq。",
  ["range(3) yields 0, 1, 2. range(1, 4) starts at 1; range(0, 10, 2) steps by two. It is lazy: nothing is built."] = "range(3) は 0、1、2 を生む。range(1, 4) は 1 から。range(0, 10, 2) は2つ飛び。遅延評価: 何も作られない。",
  ['raw = "12"\nqty = ___(raw)\nprint(qty + 1)     # 13, not "121"\n'] = 'raw = "12"\nqty = ___(raw)\nprint(qty + 1)     # 13、"121" ではない\n',
  ["ready := make(chan struct{})\ngo func() {\n    menu = loadMenu()\n    ___(ready)\n}()\n<-ready\nuse(menu)\n"] = "ready := make(chan struct{})\ngo func() {\n    menu = loadMenu()\n    ___(ready)\n}()\n<-ready\nuse(menu)\n",
  ["recv blocks with no busy loop. Not while let: its temporaries live for the whole body and would hold the lock during job()."] = "recv はビジーループなしでブロックする。while let ではダメ: 一時値が本体の間ずっと生きて、job() の実行中も鍵を握ってしまう。",
  ["reqwest::get(url).await?.text().await? - two awaits, two places it can fail. Riders roll out."] = "reqwest::get(url).await?.text().await? - await が2回、失敗しうる場所も2つ。ライダーたちが出発する。",
  ["res := make(chan Menu, 1)\n___ func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nprintReceipt()\n"] = "res := make(chan Menu, 1)\n___ func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nprintReceipt()\n",
  ["res := make(chan Menu, 1)\ngo func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nprintReceipt()\nm := ___\n"] = "res := make(chan Menu, 1)\ngo func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nprintReceipt()\nm := ___\n",
  ["res := make(chan Menu, ___)\ngo func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nselect {\ncase m := <-res:\n    use(m)\ncase <-ctx.Done():\n}\n"] = "res := make(chan Menu, ___)\ngo func() { res <- fetchMenu() }()\nselect {\ncase m := <-res:\n    use(m)\ncase <-ctx.Done():\n}\n",
  ["result() is await, and it re-raises the worker's exception in your process with the child's traceback attached."] = "result() が await であり、ワーカーの例外を子のトレースバック付きであなたのプロセスで投げ直す。",
  ["return 0; exits at once. The tail expression n * 18 - 5 handles every other case."] = "return 0; はすぐに抜ける。末尾の式 n * 18 - 5 が残りのケースをすべて処理する。",
  ["return s. A function that falls off the end returns None. return a, b hands back a tuple."] = "return s。最後まで落ちた関数は None を返す。return a, b はタプルを返す。",
  ["return sends every result at once. The bool and the error travel together."] = "return はすべての結果を一度に返します。bool と error は一緒に運ばれます。",
  ["return wrapper, not wrapper(). The caller gets the wrapper and calls it later; *args, **kwargs pass anything through."] = "return wrapper、wrapper() ではない。呼び出し側はラッパーを受け取り、後で呼ぶ。*args, **kwargs が何でも通す。",
  ["rune is one code point. 'x' literals are runes, \"x\" literals are strings."] = "rune はコードポイントひとつ。'x' リテラルは rune、\"x\" リテラルは string です。",
  ["runtime.NumCPU() is the usual pool size for CPU-bound work. For I/O-bound work the right number is higher and only a benchmark knows it."] = "CPU 律速の仕事なら runtime.NumCPU() がふつうのプール数。I/O 律速ならもっと多く、正しい数はベンチマークだけが知っている。",
  ["rx.recv() blocks until a value arrives; Err when every Sender is gone. Order 7 hits the pass."] = "rx.recv() は値が届くまでブロックする。Sender が全部消えると Err。7 番の注文がパスに届く。",
  ['s := "灣"\nfmt.Println(len(s))     // prints ___\n'] = 's := "灣"\nfmt.Println(len(s))     // ___ と表示\n',
  ["s := ___{1, 2, 3}     // slice, length 3\n"] = "s := ___{1, 2, 3}     // slice、長さ 3\n",
  ["s[1:3] is a slice of a slice. Changing two[0] changes tray[1] too."] = "s[1:3] は slice の slice。two[0] を変えると tray[1] も変わります。",
  ["seats as f64. i32 / f64 does not compile in Rust; as makes the intent explicit."] = "seats as f64。Rust では i32 / f64 はコンパイルできない。as で意図を明示する。",
  ["seats is an i32 but the division needs a float. Which keyword converts it?"] = "seats は i32 だが、割り算には浮動小数点が要る。変換するキーワードは？",
  ["seen := map[int]int{}          // value -> index\nfor i, x := range nums {\n    if j, ok := seen[target-___]; ok {\n        return []int{j, i}\n    }\n    seen[x] = i\n}\n"] = "seen := map[int]int{}          // 値 -> インデックス\nfor i, x := range nums {\n    if j, ok := seen[target-___]; ok {\n        return []int{j, i}\n    }\n    seen[x] = i\n}\n",
  ["seen := map[string]___{}\nfor _, g := range guests {        // one pass: O(n)\n    if seen[g] { dup = true }\n    seen[g] = true\n}\n"] = "seen := map[string]___{}\nfor _, g := range guests {        // 一巡: O(n)\n    if seen[g] { dup = true }\n    seen[g] = true\n}\n",
  ["seen = ___()\nfor g in guests:            # one pass: O(n)\n    if g in seen:\n        dup = True\n    seen.add(g)\n"] = "seen = ___()\nfor g in guests:            # 一巡: O(n)\n    if g in seen:\n        dup = True\n    seen.add(g)\n",
  ["seen.insert(m) is one lookup for check and mark. Without it, a loop in the map queues forever."] = "seen.insert(m) は確認と印つけを 1 回の検索で済ませる。これがないと、路線図の閉路で永遠にキューが伸びる。",
  ["seen[x] = i maps value to position. Returning (seen[target - x], i) gives the pair of indexes the question wants."] = "seen[x] = i は値を位置に対応させる。(seen[target - x], i) を返すと問題が求めるインデックスの組になる。",
  ["select"] = "select",
  ["select waits on several channel ops. default is the non-blocking branch."] = "select は複数の channel 操作を待ちます。default がノンブロッキングの分岐です。",
