  ["with calls __enter__ on the way in and __exit__ on the way out, exception or not. Go's defer, scoped to a block."] = "with は入るときに __enter__、出るときに __exit__ を呼ぶ。例外があってもなくても。ブロックにスコープされた Go の defer。",
  ["with lock: is acquire and release, even on error. served += 1 is not atomic, GIL or no GIL."] = "with lock: は acquire と release、エラー時も。served += 1 はアトミックではない。GIL があってもなくても。",
  ["with lock: is the same thing with the finally written for you, which is why nobody writes acquire by hand any more."] = "with lock: は同じことを、finally まで書いてくれる形にしたものだ。だからもう誰も手で acquire を書かない。",
